{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VbAomD0vuD1794220214.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德甲，弗賴堡主場2-0擊敗柏林聯。</p><p></p><p>紅衫弗賴堡，靠對方鳥龍球領先。柏林聯隊長蘭尼基迪拉，踢入自己龍門，弗賴堡全場20射9中，柏林聯就4射0中。</p><p></p><p>12分鐘後，日本中場鈴木唯人窄位射入，為主隊拉開兩球。雖然基科之後射失十二碼，仍保著贏2-0。弗賴堡各項賽事四連勝，聯賽排第三。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.817485+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:16:58.870871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:25.190694+00:00","content_hash":"f999d836985afefa70bba01861cc8b6f7e51bc68a7de8fb88ed6109633fd39fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.817485+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}